<title>ITALY: La Fondiaria 1H96 parent pretax profit up.</title>
<headline>La Fondiaria 1H96 parent pretax profit up.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>    Parent pre-tax profit	68.6   vs   28.8</p>
<p>    Cons pre-tax profit	  27.9   vs  113.4</p>
<p>    Total premium income    1,246.5   (up 4.16 pct)</p>
<p>    Life premium income	 202     (up 4.08 pct)</p>
<p>    Non-life premium income   891.2   (up 4.88 pct)</p>
<p>Note - La Fondiaria Assicurazioni is 33 percent owned by Compart, formerly known as Ferruzzi Finanziaria.  </p>
<p>La Fondiaria said its consolidated pretax profit was influenced by extraordinary gains of 59 billion compared with extraordinary gains of 190 billion in the same 1995 period.</p>
<p>Fondiaria said it was also starting towards a conclusive phase in negotiations between its subsidiary Milano Assicurazioni and Istituto San Paolo di Torino.</p>
<p>--Milan bureau +392 66129507</p>
</text>
